      "side": 1,
      "message": "Oooh, good catch. Actually, in addition to `/res-`, I also see`/res_` and `_res/` and `_resources` from things like\n\n* chrome/android/java/res_base/font/chrome_google_sans_text_medium.xml\n* components/payments/content/android/minimal_java_res/drawable/payments_item_background_rounded.xml\n* components/browser_ui/settings/android/java/managed_prefs_java_resources/layout/chrome_managed_preference.xml\n\nIt\u0027d be nice to actually rename them all to /res_*/ but that\u0027s a lot of churn for a couple extra checks, and the extra checks are probably more durable for people making similar changes in the future. I guess we could have a presubmit that files that get put into a `android_resources` target have paths that match some sort of pattern. But probably not worth it for now.",
